s me out of the story.</p><p>- I haven&rsquo;t played the Matriarch yet but she looks too easy? &nbsp;Like Baron Blade has 10-health minions so of course he&rsquo;s hard. &nbsp;Matriarch has a bunch of 1-HP birds, what are they gonna do?</p><p>- Like if you agree!</p>",
