        "created_at": "2018-04-01T21:16:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You forgot a few things I feel:</p><p>It's clearly just a Magic: the Gathering ripoff, for starters.</p><p>It's so easy anyway, all you have to do is play your best card at the most opportune time.</p><p>Boring and uninspired too; it's just nothing but doing algebra with superheroes as window dressing.</p><p>Tachyon is so weak; all she can do is look at and discard a card (isn't that usually a bad thing?) and do useless plink damage now and then.</p>",
